# Phase 14 plan 03 (DB-13, T-14-15): TLS certificate/key material for the
# dev/CI Postgres container. Generated INSIDE the container by
# docker/pg-tls-entrypoint.sh into the named `mega_crm_db_certs` volume, never
# bind-mounted into this working tree by design -- ignored here defensively
# anyway, so a private key can never be committed even if a future change (a
# local debugging bind-mount, a different compose override) puts one on disk
# under docker/.
docker/certs/
docker/*.key
docker/*.pem
docker/*.crt
